      "text": "A VISUAL GUIDE TO ARTERIAL HEALTH\nHow narrowing changes blood flow\nA cross-section comparison of an open artery and one affected by plaque.\n01\nNormal artery\nWIDE, OPEN PASSAGE\n02\nConstricted artery\nNARROWED BY PLAQUE\nOPEN LUMEN\nVESSEL WALL\nPLAQUE BUILDUP\nNARROW LUMEN\nSmooth, steady flow\nBlood passes easily through the wide opening.\nHigh-pressure, restricted flow\nPlaque reduces the opening and raises resistance.\nEducational illustration. Vessel anatomy is simplified and not to scale.\nArtery comparison infographic | 16:9 format\nDownload SVG\nDownload PNG",
