      "text": "artery.\nHealth, illustrated.\nAbout this guide\nSave infographic\nBlood flow, side by side: normal artery versus constricted artery\nYOUR ARTERIES, EXPLAINED\nBlood flow, side by side.\nSee how an open artery compares to one narrowed by plaque.\nNormal artery\nHEALTHY\nSmooth artery wall\nClear, open passage\nSmooth, steady flow.\nBlood moves freely through a smooth, open vessel.\nConstricted artery\nNARROWED\nPlaque buildup\nNarrowed passage\nMore resistance. Higher pressure.\nPlaque narrows the passage, making blood harder to push through.\nA simplified educational illustration. Not to scale.\nWhy does this matter?\nShow labels\nPause flow",
